BT /F2 8.5 Tf 62.00 401.50 Td (AHA 1 \(Linux Kernel\): The OS is a Traffic Cop; Everything is a File Descriptor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 441.04 401.50 Td (Processes never touch hardware;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 62.00 390.00 Td (they execute syscalls \(read, write, epoll_wait\). Every socket, file, pipe, and device is just an integer index in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 62.00 378.50 Td (the process table. Zero-copy \(sendfile\) bypasses user RAM entirely.) Tj ET
