BT /F1 8.5 Tf 474.36 364.00 Td (Arrays win in RAM because) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 62.00 352.50 Td (contiguous bytes trigger CPU L1/L2 hardware prefetching. Trees and hash tables incur random memory jumps. B-Trees) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 62.00 341.00 Td (dominate on disk because they match 8KB filesystem block boundaries.) Tj ET
